'''Retsu Kaioh''' (烈海王, ''Retsu Kaiō'', '''Kaiou Retsu''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Retsu Kaioh
|image = E 725.png
|first appearance = [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
As the master of Chinese kempo, Retsu Kaioh is a backliner with huge range, fast attacks, and even a chance to Freeze your units. Make sure not to underestimate Retsu, or else you might just be sent to the hospital with only your head remaining and nothing else.

==Strategy==
Similarly to [[Katsumi Orochi (Enemy)|Katsumi Orochi]], the main way to beat him is to use fast chipping units like [[Fishman Cat]] or [[Courier Cat]]. Tankers like [[Manic Jamiera Cat]] are also an option.

